The Lord's Lair is accessed through the [[Portal]] and is unlocked after getting an ice cream and reaching [[Maelstrom]]. To complete Lord's Lair, you firstly need to light the four torches in order to unlock the 5th monster in After Life, '''The Torch''', which is needed to beat the 91st to 100th boss.
